  "<b>Double Direction</b>\nTwo consecutive notes for the same hand with the same cut direction, within a short time window.\n": "<b>同向双连</b>\n同一只手在短时间内连续击打两个方向相同的音符。\n",
  "<b>Handclap Pattern</b>\nDetects risky handclap patterns which may result in controllers clashing.": "<b>拍手模式</b>\n检测可能导致控制器碰撞的高风险拍手模式。",
  "<b>Notes Near Wall Edges</b>\nChecks for notes, bombs, and chains that occur very close to the start or end edge of a wall obstacle.": "<b>靠近墙体边缘的音符</b>\n检查是否有音符、炸弹和连锁音符过于靠近墙体障碍物的起始或结束边缘。",
  "<b>Objects Inside Walls</b>\nEnsures that no beatmap objects (notes, bombs, chains) are placed inside the spatial and temporal bounds of any wall obstacle.": "<b>墙内物体</b>\n确保没有谱面对象（音符、炸弹、连锁音符）位于任何墙体障碍物的空间和时间范围内。",
  "<b>Parallell Notes</b>\nChecks for clusters of notes (for the same hand) that occur at the same time (within a small beat window) and ensures their spatial layout and cut directions conform to allowed patterns.": "<b>平行音符</b>\n检查同一只手的音符簇是否在同一时间（较小的节拍窗口内）出现，并确保其空间布局和切割方向符合允许的模式。",
  "<b>Stacked Notes</b>\nDetects when two or more objects (notes, bombs, or chain endpoints) are placed at the exact same time and position (cell) in the beatmap.": "<b>堆叠音符</b>\n检测谱面中是否有两个或更多对象（音符、炸弹或连锁音符端点）被放置在完全相同的时间和位置（格子）上。",
  "<b>Vision Blocks</b>\nDetects where an element in the center lanes acts as an \"occluder\" blocking the player's view of upcoming objects in the same half of the grid for a duration defined by the \"Half Jump Duration\" (HJD).": "<b>视野遮挡块</b>\n检测中央车道中的元素是否在由“半跳跃时长”（HJD）定义的持续时间内充当“遮挡物”，阻挡玩家查看同一网格半区中即将出现的对象。",
